so collect certain information about your device or usage by automated means, including using technologies such as cookies, web server logs and web beacons."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phone numbers or SMS opt-in information will not be shared with any third-party affiliates or marketing organizations. For full details regarding SMS communication, please refer to our SMS Terms & Conditions section. We collect phone numbers for the purpose of sending SMS communications. This information is only used for sending appointment reminders, billing inquiries, promotions, or any other business-related messages as consented by the user."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Updates To Our Privacy Policy","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect changes in our privacy practices. We will post a prominent notice on our website to notify you of any significant changes to our Privacy Policy and indicate at the top of the Policy when it was most recently updated."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How To Contact Us","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have any questions or comments about this Privacy Policy, or if you would like to exercise your rights, please email "},{"type":"text","text":"support@odsep.com","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"mailto:support@odsep.com"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}}$json$::jsonb);
